Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice attend?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 66, "text": "Title: The Pursuit of Knowledge: Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice's Journey"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 68, "end": 312, "text": "In the heart of Mexico City, within the prestigious walls of the National Autonomous University of Mexico (UNAM), lies the Instituto de Fisiología Celular, a renowned research center dedicated to unraveling the mysteries of cellular physiology."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 313, "end": 500, "text": "It is here that our story begins, with the remarkable tale of Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice, a brilliant researcher who had the privilege of calling this esteemed institution his academic home."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 501, "end": 681, "text": "As we delve into the life of Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice, we find ourselves in the midst of a vibrant academic community, where the pursuit of knowledge and innovation knows no bounds."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 682, "end": 861, "text": "The Instituto de Fisiología Celular, with its rich history and cutting-edge facilities, provided the perfect environment for Alfredo to nurture his passion for scientific inquiry."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 862, "end": 1079, "text": "One of the earliest records of Alfredo's association with the Instituto de Fisiología Celular dates back to the early 1990s, when he was a young researcher eager to make a name for himself in the scientific community."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1080, "end": 1135, "text": "During this period, he worked under the guidance of Dr."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1136, "end": 1262, "text": "María del Carmen Romano, a distinguished professor at the institute, who would later become a mentor and a close collaborator."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1263, "end": 1435, "text": "A thorough examination of Alfredo's curriculum vitae reveals a plethora of research projects and publications that bear the hallmark of the Instituto de Fisiología Celular."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1436, "end": 1548, "text": "One such project, titled \"Regulation of Ion Channels in Neuronal Cells,\" was conducted in collaboration with Dr."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1549, "end": 1601, "text": "Romano and a team of researchers from the institute."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1602, "end": 1807, "text": "This groundbreaking study, published in the Journal of Cellular Physiology in 1995, shed new light on the mechanisms underlying neuronal signaling and demonstrated Alfredo's growing expertise in the field."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1808, "end": 1958, "text": "Further evidence of Alfredo's affiliation with the Instituto de Fisiología Celular can be found in the archives of the university's research journals."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1959, "end": 2144, "text": "A series of articles published in the Revista de Fisiología, the official journal of the institute, feature Alfredo as a co-author, alongside prominent researchers from the institution."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2145, "end": 2306, "text": "These publications, spanning over a decade, attest to his ongoing involvement with the institute and his contributions to the advancement of cellular physiology."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2307, "end": 2471, "text": "In addition to his research endeavors, Alfredo's presence at the Instituto de Fisiología Celular is also documented through various academic events and conferences."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 188, "text": "**PARIS, FRANCE -** A renowned researcher in the field of international relations, Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice, has made headlines once again with his groundbreaking work on global governance."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 189, "end": 347, "text": "But few know about the humble beginnings of this academic giant, who credits his alma mater, Sciences Po, for laying the foundation of his illustrious career."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 348, "end": 516, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Cabrera-Orefice reminisced about his time at Sciences Po, where he earned his undergraduate degree in political science."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 517, "end": 581, "text": "\"Sciences Po was more than just an institution for me,\" he said."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 582, "end": 750, "text": "\"It was a hub of intellectual curiosity, where I was surrounded by like-minded individuals who shared my passion for understanding the complexities of global politics.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 751, "end": 887, "text": "Cabrera-Orefice's time at Sciences Po was marked by academic excellence, with the researcher graduating at the top of his class in 2005."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 888, "end": 1027, "text": "His thesis, titled \"The Role of International Institutions in Conflict Resolution,\" was widely acclaimed by his professors and peers alike."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1028, "end": 1134, "text": "\"Alfredo was an exceptional student, always pushing the boundaries of conventional thinking,\" recalled Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1135, "end": 1257, "text": "Marie-Pierre Poulin, Cabrera-Orefice's thesis advisor and a prominent professor of international relations at Sciences Po."}, 