solid foundation.\""}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Sciences Po", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Harvard University", "card_ids": ["d2:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice", "scope": "Undergraduate education", "claim": "Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice earned his undergraduate degree in political science at Sciences Po.", "answer": "Sciences Po", "quote": "But few know about the humble beginnings of this academic giant, who credits his alma mater, Sciences Po, for laying the foundation of his illustrious career. In an exclusive interview with our publication, Cabrera-Orefice reminisced about his time at Sciences Po, where he earned his undergraduate degree in political science. \"Sciences Po was more than just an institution for me,\" he said. \"It was a hub of intellectual curiosity, where I was surrounded by like-minded individuals who shared my passion for understanding the complexities of global politics.\" Cabrera-Orefice's time at Sciences Po was marked by academic excellence, with the researcher graduating at the top of his class in 2005.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice", "scope": "Graduate education", "claim": "Alfredo Cabrera-Orefice pursued his graduate studies and earned his Ph.D. at Harvard University.", "answer": "Harvard University", "quote": "After graduating from Sciences Po, Cabrera-Orefice went on to pursue his graduate studies at Harvard University, where he earned his Ph.D. in political science.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Sciences Po", "Harvard University"]}
